cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fastOCS: randomized-SVD Optimum Contribution Selection with a robust extension"
abstract: >-
  Code for RSVD-OCS, a randomized-SVD approach to Optimum Contribution
  Selection (OCS) for large genomic relationship matrices in tree breeding,
  plus a robust extension (ROCS) that accounts for breeding-value
  uncertainty. Includes a Norway spruce case study, a QTL-MAS 2010 benchmark,
  and a small synthetic quickstart example.
type: software
